  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nI try to receive mails from matrix server but it won't working.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- added smtp configuration to homeserver.yaml as described [here](https://github.com/devture/email2matrix/blob/master/etc/services/matrix-synapse/homeserver.yaml)\r\n\r\n```\r\nemail:\r\n   enable_notifs: false\r\n   smtp_host: mail.domain.com\r\n   smtp_port: 465\r\n   smtp_user: \"matrix@domain.com\"       #tried with \" and without\r\n   smtp_pass: \"secret_password\"         #tried with \" and without\r\n   require_transport_security: true\r\n   notif_from: \"Your Friendly %(app)s Home Server <noreply@example.com>\"\r\n   app_name: Matrix\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen I tried to add a mail address to one of my users. `Element` tells me that it will send a mail for verification but this one never arrives. I doublecked inbox and spam.\r\n\r\nI have re-created the smtp mailbox more than once an double-checked spelling of each entry. It is correct at any time.\r\n\r\nNo idea wher to seach and find a solution.\r\n\r\nAny help appreciated.\r\n\r\n### Homeserver\r\n\r\nmatrix.domain.com\r\n\r\n### Synapse Version\r\n\r\n{\"server_version\":\"1.77.0\",\"python_version\":\"3.10.6\"}\r\n\r\n### Installation Method\r\n\r\nOther (please mention below)\r\n\r\n### Database\r\n\r\nPostgres\r\n\r\n### Workers\r\n\r\nSingle process\r\n\r\n### Platform\r\n\r\nUbuntu 22.04\r\n\r\n### Configuration\r\n\r\n.\r\n\r\n### Relevant log output\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n.\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\r\n\r\n_No response_",
